  "description": "OEDRO running boards feature welded brackets and an carbon steel construction for exceptional strength and maximum rocker panel protection. Designed for quick and easy installation with minimal accessories—no cutting or drilling required.\nFeatures\nEnhanced Accessibility: Perfect for children, seniors, and passengers with limited mobility, offering a secure and comfortable step—especially for lifted vehicles.\nCleaner Interior: The textured surface helps remove dirt, mud, and snow from shoes, keeping your car’s interior cleaner.\nBody Protection: Shields your vehicle’s side panels from chips and scratches caused by road debris, preserving its paintwork.\nDual-Step Convenience: Two-level steps provide easier access to lifted vehicles, roof racks, and cargo, making every journey more convenient.\nDurable & Non-Slip: Made from precision-cut Carbon steel with a powder-coated, anti-slip finish for a strong grip in all weather conditions and easy maintenance.\n1-Year Warranty & Installation: Backed by a one-year warranty. For safety, professional installation is recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2010–2024 Toyota 4Runner Trail Edition;\nCompatible with 2014–2024 Toyota 4Runner SR5, TRD Off-Road, TRD Off-Road Premium, and TRD Pro.\nWithout factory lower rocker panel trim / cladding.",
